    { "en": "I could not hear the actors.", "zh": "我听不见演员的台词。" },
    { "en": "I turned round and looked at them angrily.", "zh": "我转过身去，生气地看着他们。" },
    { "en": "They did not pay any attention.", "zh": "他们却毫不理会。" },
    { "en": "I said angrily, 'I can't hear a word!'", "zh": "我生气地说：“我一个字也听不见！”" },
